(Secure Face Registration and Verification Framework) Tj
T*
/F1 13 Tf
16 TL
(Final Project Report) Tj
T*
/F1 10 Tf
14 TL
(Project Codename: Nishika     Report Date: August 6, 2026) Tj
T*
T*
/F2 13 Tf
18 TL
(1. Problem Statement) Tj
T*
/F1 10 Tf
13 TL
(This system acts as a security guard for face-based login, with two jobs. First, when) Tj
T*
(someone signs up \(registration\), it takes a clear photo of their face and remembers it.) Tj
T*
(Second, when someone logs in later \(verification\), it looks at their face again and) Tj
T*
(answers two questions: is this a real, live person right now, and does this face belong) Tj
T*
(to the person who signed up.) Tj
T*
T*
(A face-matching system alone can be fooled by a printed photo, a video, or a phone) Tj
T*
(screen. This system adds two more capabilities: liveness detection \(is this a real,) Tj
T*
(live person\) and image quality assessment \(is the photo even usable\). The two phases) Tj
T*
(-- registration and verification -- share one pipeline with two entry points, reusing) Tj
T*
(the same quality, liveness, and matching logic.) Tj
T*
T*
/F2 13 Tf
18 TL
(2. Approach and Architecture) Tj
T*
/F1 10 Tf
13 TL
(Shared pipeline: Capture \(WebRTC webcam frame\) -> Face Detection \(MediaPipe, rejects) Tj
T*
(0 or more than 1 face\) -> Quality Assessment \(7-check weighted composite score\) ->) Tj
T*
(Liveness Detection \(Passive: MiniFASNet; Active: blink or head-turn challenge\) -> Face) Tj
T*
(Embedding \(ArcFace via DeepFace, pretrained\).) Tj
T*
T*
(After embedding, the pipeline forks:) Tj
T*
(- Registration: Consent gate -> Duplicate check \(cosine similarity vs. existing) Tj
T*
(  templates, threshold 0.68\) -> Store template \(Fernet AES-128 encrypted at rest,) Tj
T*
(  front-facing only\).) Tj
T*
(- Verification: Fetch all active users' templates -> 1-to-N cosine-similarity match,) Tj
T*
(  accept at score 0.40 or higher -> Accept/Reject, logged to verification_logs.) Tj
T*
T*
(Deployment: three local components on one machine, no cloud dependency -- Streamlit) Tj
T*
(UI \(with streamlit-webrtc for the camera\) -> FastAPI backend \(/register, /verify\) ->) Tj
T*
(SQLite \(local file: users, templates, access_log, verification_logs\). API-key auth) Tj
T*
(and a sliding-window rate limiter sit in front of the backend.) Tj
T*
T*
(Deliberate change from the original brief: registration originally captured three) Tj
T*
(angles \(front/left/right\); this was simplified to a single front-facing capture --) Tj
T*
(full rationale in Section 4.) Tj
ET
endstream
endobj
