(3. Results - Real Measured Numbers) Tj
T*
/F2 12 Tf
16 TL
(3.1 Face Matching Accuracy \(Frontal-vs-Frontal, the production path\)) Tj
T*
/F3 10 Tf
13 TL
(Equal Error Rate \(EER\):              3.19% at threshold 0.2642) Tj
T*
(ROC AUC:                             0.9953) Tj
T*
(At threshold 0.40 - False Accept Rate:   0.34% \(2/595\)) Tj
T*
(At threshold 0.40 - False Reject Rate:   15.09% \(16/106\)) Tj
T*
(Half Total Error Rate \(HTER\):        7.72%) Tj
T*
T*
/F1 10 Tf
(The mathematically "optimal" threshold \(0.2642\) was deliberately not used -- its) Tj
T*
(3.19% false-accept rate is too high for a security-critical system. The deployed) Tj
T*
(threshold of 0.40 forces near-zero false acceptance, accepting a higher false-) Tj
T*
(rejection rate as the tradeoff: a false reject simply re-prompts the user within) Tj
T*
(milliseconds, while a false accept is a real security failure.) Tj
T*
T*
/F2 12 Tf
16 TL
(3.2 Passive Liveness / Attack Detection) Tj
T*
/F1 10 Tf
13 TL
(Re-measured on an expanded sample \(n=76 attacks / n=75 genuine\), superseding an) Tj
T*
(earlier n=5 figure that was too small to trust.) Tj
T*
T*
/F3 10 Tf
(At deployed threshold 0.90:) Tj
T*
(  APCER \(attacks wrongly accepted\):   46.05% \(35/76\) -- worse than the earlier estimate) Tj
T*
(  BPCER \(genuine wrongly rejected\):   0.00% \(0/75\)) Tj
T*
(  ACER:                               0.230) Tj
T*
T*
(Per attack type:) Tj
T*
(  Printed Photo            5.3% missed   - reliably caught) Tj
T*
(  Screen Replay \(Phone\)    5.3% missed   - reliably caught) Tj
T*
(  Screen Replay \(Laptop\)   73.7% missed  - REAL, CONFIRMED WEAKNESS) Tj
T*
(  Frozen Frame             100% missed   - expected, handled by active liveness) Tj
T*
T*
/F1 10 Tf
(A threshold sweep shows raising the deployed threshold to 0.95-0.96 is a free) Tj
T*
(improvement in this sample \(genuine users unaffected\), but no threshold fully closes) Tj
T*
(the laptop-replay gap without a real cost to genuine acceptance. This report does) Tj
T*
(not change the deployed threshold -- that decision is left to the project owner) Tj
T*
(with this evidence in hand.) Tj
ET
endstream
endobj
