(3.3 Quality Assessment Profile Acceptance) Tj
T*
/F1 10 Tf
13 TL
(Composite score combines 7 sub-checks \(Contrast and Resolution added this pass\).) Tj
T*
T*
/F3 10 Tf
(  Lenient \(50% threshold\):      100% acceptance \(genuine captures\)) Tj
T*
(  Balanced \(70%, default\):      0% acceptance \(small calibration sample\)) Tj
T*
(  Strict \(85% threshold\):       0% acceptance) Tj
T*
T*
/F2 13 Tf
18 TL
(4. Limitations and Scope Decisions - Stated Plainly) Tj
T*
/F1 10 Tf
13 TL
(Physiological liveness \(rPPG\) - deferred. Built and calibrated offline \(heartbeat) Tj
T*
(detection from skin color\) but not wired into the live pipeline; it needs a stable) Tj
T*
(10-15 second capture window that does not fit the current per-tick UI model.) Tj
T*
T*
(Active liveness covers 2 challenge types \(blink, head-turn\). A direct test confirmed) Tj
T*
(the expected consequence: a replayed video of a real blink is accepted \(status:) Tj
T*
(pass\). Landmark-based active liveness cannot distinguish a live blink from a) Tj
T*
(recorded one -- exactly why the system does not rely on it alone.) Tj
T*
T*
(Occlusion detection is a visibility-based approximation, not a trained classifier.) Tj
T*
(It can flag likely obstruction but not identify what is causing it.) Tj
T*
T*
(Demographic bias - confirmed, unmitigated. Measured across 80 real images: quality) Tj
T*
(pass rate 20.0% \(female\) vs. 42.5% \(male\); liveness pass rate 25.0% \(senior\) vs.) Tj
T*
(46.2% \(middle-aged\); a smaller but present skin-tone gap. No mitigation attempted.) Tj
T*
T*
(Multi-angle enrollment simplified to front-only. The original three-angle flow was) Tj
T*
(unreliable in practice, and duplicate-detection and verification already relied on) Tj
T*
(the front template almost exclusively for accuracy.) Tj
T*
T*
(A known, intermittent WebRTC connection hiccup exists -- the camera connection can) Tj
T*
(silently drop for 20-30 seconds and self-recover. Root-caused as far as the) Tj
T*
(evidence allows to a library-level characteristic, not an application bug.) Tj
T*
(Mitigation: keep continuous camera segments under about 30 seconds during live) Tj
T*
(demonstrations.) Tj
ET
endstream
endobj
