(Computer Vision: face detection and landmark geometry, solvePnP-based head pose) Tj
T*
(recovery, and classical statistical quality proxies chosen deliberately over a) Tj
T*
(heavier trained model.) Tj
T*
T*
(Face Recognition: ArcFace embeddings, cosine similarity matching, and the) Tj
T*
(distinction between a mathematically optimal threshold and one chosen for a) Tj
T*
(security-first tradeoff.) Tj
T*
T*
(Liveness Detection: a three-layer design motivated by the fact that single-method) Tj
T*
(liveness is foolable -- demonstrated concretely by this project's own testing.) Tj
T*
T*
(Biometric Authentication: consent gating, duplicate detection, encryption at rest,) Tj
T*
(and GDPR/BIPA-oriented deletion, implemented as core requirements, not) Tj
T*
(afterthoughts.) Tj
T*
T*
(API Development: a FastAPI backend with key-based auth and rate limiting, kept) Tj
T*
(cleanly separate from the core pipeline so both the API and UI share one source) Tj
T*
(of truth.) Tj
T*
T*
(Performance Evaluation: industry-standard metrics \(APCER/BPCER/ACER, EER/ROC/) Tj
T*
(AUC, HTER\) rather than one invented accuracy figure, including the discipline of) Tj
